classDiagram
    class AnalyticsApp {
      -Scanner SCANNER
      +main(String[] args) void
    }
    class CsvReader {
      +read(Path path) List~Map~String,String~~
      -parseLine(String line) List~String~
    }
    class AnalyticsReport {
      -List rows
      -Map sourceVisits
      -Map pageViews
      -Map dailyVisits
      +AnalyticsReport(List rows)
      +print() void
      -top(Map map, int limit) Map
      -recommend() void
    }
    AnalyticsApp ..> CsvReader : reads CSV
    AnalyticsApp ..> AnalyticsReport : builds report
    AnalyticsReport : validates and aggregates data